    {
      "id": "77068cbebed6-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If ABCD is a rhombus such that &ang;ACB = 50&deg;, then &ang;BDC will be:",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If ABCD is a rhombus such that&nbsp;&ang;ACB = 50&deg;, then &ang;BDC will be:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/02/F3_Madhuri_SSC_09.02.2023_D1.png\" style=\"width: 207px; height: 240px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "40&deg;",
          "html": "<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">40&deg;</font></font>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "50&deg;",
          "html": "<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">50&deg;</font></font>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "60&deg;",
          "html": "60&deg;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "55&deg;",
          "html": "<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">55&deg;</font></font>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>∠OCB = 50° = ∠OCD and ∠COD = ∠BOC = 90° </p>\n\n<p>In an ΔOCD, </p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">∠OCD + ∠DOC + ∠ODC = 180°  </span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">⇒  </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">50° + 90° + ∠ODC = 180°  </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">⇒ </span>∠ODC = 180° - 90° - 50° <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">⇒ </span>∠ODC = 40° = ∠BDC</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/02/F3_Madhuri_SSC_09.02.2023_D1.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
