      "question": "A rhombus has diagonals of lengths 10 cm and 24 cm. What is its perimeter (in cm) ?",
      "questionHtml": "A rhombus has diagonals of lengths 10 cm and 24 cm. What is its perimeter (in cm) ?&nbsp;",
